1
00:00:00,736 --> 00:00:02,656
(Sheldon:)She made spaghetti
with little hot dogs.

2
00:00:02,822 --> 00:00:05,032
(Sheldon:)I like spaghetti with little hot dogs.

3
00:00:05,575 --> 00:00:08,155
Well, then why did you
have Chinese food with us?

4
00:00:08,327 --> 00:00:10,077
I didn't wanna upset you.

5
00:00:10,246 --> 00:00:13,876
(Sheldon:)Howard made it very clear that my
allegiance should be to male comrades...

6
00:00:14,041 --> 00:00:16,751
(Sheldon:)...before women who sell their bodies
for money.

7
00:00:19,338 --> 00:00:22,838
(Leonard:)Is it possible he said,
"Bros before ho's"?

8
00:00:23,926 --> 00:00:27,516
(Sheldon:)Yes, but I rephrased it
to avoid offending the ho's.

9
00:00:29,432 --> 00:00:33,062
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I don't care
if you wanna be friends with Penny.

10
00:00:33,477 --> 00:00:34,807
(Penny:)Oh.

11
00:00:35,521 --> 00:00:37,611
So the turmoil
that has been keeping me...

12
00:00:37,773 --> 00:00:40,653
(Sheldon:)...from achieving REM sleep
was entirely unjustified?

13
00:00:41,652 --> 00:00:42,732
(Sheldon:)Yes.

14
00:00:42,904 --> 00:00:46,114
(Sheldon:)Well, then as my meemaw would say...

15
00:00:46,282 --> 00:00:50,242
(Sheldon:)...looks like we butchered a pig,
but nobody wanted bacon.

16
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:53,540
(Leonard:)I guess not.

17
00:00:54,165 --> 00:00:58,025
(Sheldon:)And now, as promised, the tangent.

